    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d607">

                <pb facs="0638" n="526" xml:id="pg526"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">His Majesty King George
                            V to President Taft</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >London</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1910-05-07"><hi rendition="#italic">May 7,
                        1910</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>I am deeply grateful to you, your Government, and people for your condolence on
                    the death of my beloved father and for your good wishes for my future
                    prosperity.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">George R. and I</hi>.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
